#X text 240 83 A stereo ASR (Attack / Sustain / Release) envelope generator
with three stages: attack (rise from 0 to 1) \, sustain (hold at the
sustain level while the gate is on) and release (fall back to 0 after
the gate is turned off). Both channels are controlled by the same envelope
\, so the object is convenient for applying a single envelope shape
to a stereo signal.;
